    <!--
      Nothing here yet.

      This file held three view-tag ids, each a "skip the redundant write" guard for a
      `RecyclerView` binder: the last-bound image source, a thumb's last aspect ratio, and the last
      drawable set on an `ImageView`. All three went with the Compose migration — recomposition
      makes the guards unnecessary, and the helpers that used them were dead code kept alive by
      their own tests.

      Kept as a file rather than deleted: `ids.xml` is where an XML-declared view tag id belongs,
      and a hardcoded Int invites key collisions if one is ever needed again.
    -->
</resources>
